{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人方力申（小方）昨日（21日）完成35公里港澳慈善游壯舉，並緊接出席音樂會。</p><p>他最終以8小時37分24秒的佳績，刷新「香港至澳門游泳用時最短（男性）」健力士世界紀錄，大會更宣布是次活動合共籌得1,000萬港元善款，成績斐然。</p><p>完騷後小方接受訪</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T01:21:06.698263+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T01:01:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T01:14:15.308878+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T01:14:15.308878+00:00","content_hash":"87fc776f4524298cc04ca6d38798cc8bb48fc29aa8e65e10e62ff364092ec550","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}